{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "lA3dsKSycGfoKjc5gWW0", "type": "frame", "x": 390, "y": 20, "width": 1640, "height": 1010, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbbbbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0066", "roundness": null, "seed": 38299614, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1072493095, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791050845017, "created": 1791050845017, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "xok4JQIxTJWP0BjjSkOM", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 40, "width": 400.40000000000003, "height": 130.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 255546888, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 514617484, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791050845017, "created": 1791050845017, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CLARIFY FIRST (done by minute 5)\nWhat is ONE measurement? -> one request duration, ms,\n  per completed request (not a counter)\nWho reads it? -> engineers: by app + client version,\n  time windows, across tenants\nLoad? 100k obs/s, bursts 5x.  Fresh? queryable < 1 min\nLate? retries, up to 24 h late.  Durable? survive 1 node\nRetention: raw 30 d, aggregates 90 d.  Tenant authz", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CLARIFY FIRST (done by minute 5)\nWhat is ONE measurement? -> one request duration, ms,\n  per completed request (not a counter)\nWho reads it? -> engineers: by app + client version,\n  time windows, across tenants\nLoad? 100k obs/s, bursts 5x.  Fresh? queryable < 1 min\nLate? retries, up to 24 h late.  Durable? survive 1 node\nRetention: raw 30 d, aggregates 90 d.  Tenant authz", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Wc10nTThPh4Q8dtMLl30", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 200.0, "width": 407.55, "height": 97.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 1294573151, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1715636441, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791050845017, "created": 1791050845017, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "NUMBERS (write the multiplication)\n100,000/s x 200 B = 20 MB/s (100 MB/s burst)\n100,000 x 86,400 = 8.6 B obs/day = 1.7 TB/day raw\n30 d raw = 52 TB before 5-10x columnar compression\nDedupe ids, 24 h: 8.6 B x 16 B = 140 GB, ~3 GB x 50 parts\nAggregates: series x 1,440 min/day; small", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "NUMBERS (write the multiplication)\n100,000/s x 200 B = 20 MB/s (100 MB/s burst)\n100,000 x 86,400 = 8.6 B obs/day = 1.7 TB/day raw\n30 d raw = 52 TB before 5-10x columnar compression\nDedupe ids, 24 h: 8.6 B x 16 B = 140 GB, ~3 GB x 50 parts\nAggregates: series x 1,440 min/day; small", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "jPzPEybiCTAUH2Otiec1", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 327.5, "width": 393.25000000000006, "height": 146.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 469565579, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 548275386, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791050845017, "created": 1791050845017, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CORE ENTITIES\nObservation(event_id, tenant, app, client_version,\n  raw_name, value, unit, event_time, arrival_time)\nMetricDefinition(canonical_id, unit, boundaries, owner)\nMapping(tenant, app, client_version, raw_name ->\n  canonical_id, unit_conv, version, approved_by)\nAggregate(generation, tenant, app, client_version,\n  canonical_id, minute, count, sum, min, max, sketch)\nGeneration(id, scope, status building|live|retired)", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "CORE ENTITIES\nObservation(event_id, tenant, app, client_version,\n  raw_name, value, unit, event_time, arrival_time)\nMetricDefinition(canonical_id, unit, boundaries, owner)\nMapping(tenant, app, client_version, raw_name ->\n  canonical_id, unit_conv, version, approved_by)\nAggregate(generation, tenant, app, client_version,\n  canonical_id, minute, count, sum, min, max, sketch)\nGeneration(id, scope, status building|live|retired)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "3zSfGLg6nwCSWfPH5pxR", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 503.75, "width": 386.1, "height": 146.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 1631282766, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1265907685, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791050845017, "created": 1791050845017, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "API\nPOST /v1/observations [{event_id, app, client_version,\n  metric, value, event_time}] -> 202 {accepted ids}\n  after the replicated append; idempotent on event_id\nGET /v1/query?app&metric&from&to&step&group_by=version\n  &stat=mean|p99 -> minute series (current generation)\nPUT /v1/mappings {scope, raw_name, canonical, unit}\n  -> new mapping version (owner approval)\nPOST /v1/rebuilds {scope, from, to} -> generation g+1", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "API\nPOST /v1/observations [{event_id, app, client_version,\n  metric, value, event_time}] -> 202 {accepted ids}\n  after the replicated append; idempotent on event_id\nGET /v1/query?app&metric&from&to&step&group_by=version\n  &stat=mean|p99 -> minute series (current generation)\nPUT /v1/mappings {scope, raw_name, canonical, unit}\n  -> new mapping version (owner approval)\nPOST /v1/rebuilds {scope, from, to} -> generation g+1", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "UTnkblPdoJjuoPh9LSIE", "type": "text", "x": -900, "y": 680.0, "width": 357.50000000000006, "height": 81.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 1531535568, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1163889375, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1791050845017, "created": 1791050845017, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TWO SENTENCES IF ASKED 'WHY IS X THERE?'\nKafka: buffers a 5x burst so processors are never\n  overwhelmed; durable, so the ack means survived.\nNo priority queue: priority is not a requirement;\n  per-tenant quotas give isolation instead.", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "TWO SENTENCES IF ASKED 'WHY IS X THERE?'\nKafka: buffers a 5x burst so processors are never\n  overwhelmed; durable, so the ack means survived.\nNo priority queue: priority is not a requirement;\n  per-tenant quotas give isolation instead.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "YbK6NFOkTWeFKvQ54tj0", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 60, "width": 260, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth